    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Why inferences returned unadjusted — broken down by reason. no_registry: Sinatra registry not initialised yet. no_collector: user has no interaction history at all (first visit). no_model: user has interaction history but not enough training samples for a GBT yet (<5). empty_model: a model object exists but has 0 trees — transient state just after registry load. no_features: model is ready but the feature vector could not be generated because the user has <20 interactions. This breakdown tells you exactly where in the funnel users are stuck.",
